WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.280
Queen's Blade.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:09.980
That's a tournament created by the gods
to determine the strongest and most beautiful Queen.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:16.000
The heated battle between the assembling warriors in the Queen's capital of Gainos is about to begin.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.090
Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:36.050
Chivalrous Wasteland Thief, Risty.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.440
Veteran Mercenary, Echidna.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.350
Kiba Assassin, Irma.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.450
Forest Guardian, Nowa.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:45.350
Combat Instructor Alliene.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.460
Steel Princess, Ymir.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.370
Arms Merchant, Cattleya.

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:53.970
The Saint of the Capital, Melpha,
had the power to exorcise spirits, huh!

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.880
I lack information on Flame Master Nyx.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.160
It doesn't seem that important though!

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.880
The problem lies with these guys, huh!

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.750
Assassin of Innumerable Changes, Melona.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.170
Ancient Queen, Menace.

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:09.210
Temptress of the Underworld, Airi.

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:14.810
Anyway, these underlings of the Swamp Witch
wanted to stop Queen's Blade in the first place!

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:18.200
I never thought they would receive permission to participate.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:22.290
Maybe Queen Aldra has a big heart or that's what I'd like to think, but...

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.280
Ah, that's right, the three Vance sisters!

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:31.000
Wouldn't the eldest sister, Lightning
General Claudette, be a likely winner?

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.910
The third daughter, Imperial Commander Elina, isn't well known yet.

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:37.060
And then there's the second daughter, Vagrant Warrior Leina.

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:38.860
I think she's a lost cause.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:40.910
Nanael-san!

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:44.490
No, no, there's still the possibility of the current Queen, Aldra, winning for a third consecutive time...

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:45.800
Nanael-san!

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.190
Ah, Hachi!{her name is Hachieru} What do you think?

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:49.700
Eh? About what?{thinking you say?}

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:52.700
Of course, I'm talking about the best contestant in the current round of the competition

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:55.370
which gathers prideful warriors from across the continent

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:57.300
who battle to become Queen! Queen's Blade!

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.800
Isn't the outcome obvious?

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.040
We don't have time to talk about something like that.

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:05.240
The Head Angel is calling.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:06.390
The Head Angel?

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:11.610
During your travels, you halted the interference of the Swamp Witch...

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:15.240
and assured a safe beginning to the final selection of Queen's Blade.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.860
This is due to the activities of you two angels, without a doubt.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.990
Especially you, Nanael...

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:24.940
You journeyed together with humans, and I believe you encountered many hardships.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:26.920
Well, it wasn't that bad...

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:30.740
Well, I suppose I make a great warrior; I even have an ability or two...

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:33.010
That's why I was suited for the task.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:35.910
Well, I guess other angels would just be in the way, don't you agree?

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.120
I see no problem, then.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:40.020
Angel of Glory, Nanael...

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:44.150
I order you to participate as a warrior in Queen's Blade.

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:49.690
W-W-Why? I'm an angel!

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.980
For an angel to participate in Queen's Blade...

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:56.170
It was merely unnecessary for angels to participate in the past.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:59.360
There is no particular rule which states: angels must not participate.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.110
B-But!

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.100
This regards Queen Aldra.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.030
Aldra?

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:08.000
Queen Aldra is completely different from the Queens who preceded her.

00:03:08.590 --> 00:03:13.330
Up until now, I did not see any distinction
between the humans and the demon clans.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.400
During these past eight years,

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:19.590
Aldra, who was controlling the entire continent as Queen, deceived us.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:23.170
Pulling strings and deciding assassination targets.

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:24.680
It's an unsettling development.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:30.500
Queen's Blade exists to prevent pointless battles on Earth.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.400
No matter what she is planning...

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:37.610
Just as 120 years ago, when seeds of war and chaos were sprouted,

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.030
it is the duty of heaven to pluck these sprouts.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.040
I see, I see.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:44.680
So I'm participating in the tournament in order to infiltrate and investigate it, right?

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.810
Sounds interesting!

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:50.190
Well, becoming champion would be a trivial thing for the Angel of Glory, Nanael.

00:03:50.190 --> 00:03:52.120
But is it really alright, Head Angel?

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:58.090
Rest assured. To balance the fight against humans, a restriction will be placed upon you.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.230
A restriction?

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.460
Eh? This again?

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:05.320
This divine milk has a special technique applied to it.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.300
Technique?

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:11.320
When the milk inside is spilled, you will lose a part of your strength.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:13.750
Y-You're joking, right?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:17.260
With this, you can compete with your opponent even if they are human.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:20.460
And what would I do if I get completely beaten up?

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:23.760
I definitely won't spill any, so...

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:26.510
Regarding the divine milk which was entrusted to you before...

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:27.330
Gulp!

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:31.470
Even though you were ordered not to, you couldn't help but spill it.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.880
You spilled every last drop.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:37.970
And that wasn't all. Adding beast milk to try and trick me, eh?

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:43.560
Normally, you would be sent instantly to the Land of the Dead,

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:46.390
but wouldn't this mission be a good way to right your wrongs?

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.620
I'll gratefully take my leave, then.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.160
Well then, I'll be counting on you.{entrust to / rely on}

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.880
Ah, ju- just a minute.

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:54.470
No way!

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:57.360
Good luck!

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:20.030
Amazing, I've never seen such a city before.

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:22.610
Like I thought, we've already been through here.

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:25.470
That's strange. If this map is correct, then...

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.640
Tomoe, Shizuka.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:32.100
You haven't decided on an inn yet, either?

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:32.560
Right.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:37.350
We were told that as Queen's Blade participants, every inn would be free,

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:41.230
so I thought we could stay at the best one, but...

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:44.320
I wonder why we got lost along the way.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:50.320
Putting that aside, Leina, you aren't being accompanied by Claudette and Elina?

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.540
Yes, because they're my sisters.

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:57.210
I think I might... have to fight them.

00:05:58.520 --> 00:05:59.540
Is that so?

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:01.740
Besides...

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:07.800
I can't have anyone holding my hand anymore, or I won't be able to grow up by myself.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:10.630
Can I ask you something?

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:11.050
Yes?

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:14.590
Tomoe, why did you participate in Queen's Blade?

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.190
For my country and its people.

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:26.210
The officials who are using a young vessel as a puppet...

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:28.530
and allowing our country to decay.

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:31.880
To protect the Emperor and save the people,

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:35.160
I will use Queen's Blade to become an exceedingly strong Queen.

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:39.710
And I would use this power to exterminate those corrupted officials.

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.420
That was my intention.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:45.590
However, an even greater duty was imposed upon me.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.470
Vengeance for my companions.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:48.670
Vengeance?

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:53.030
Someone manipulated the Hinomoto ninja...

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:56.220
and attempted to stop Tomoe's departure to the mainland.

00:06:56.800 --> 00:07:00.460
At that time, Tomoe's companions perished while trying to protect her.

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:05.610
The one pulling the strings behind those ninja was most likely Aldra.

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.720
This continent's Queen.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.990
Why would the Queen do something like that?

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:12.660
We do not know.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.160
We'd like to ask her, too.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:19.330
"Do what one can, and follow your destiny."

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:22.080
It's an old saying of Hinomoto.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:26.240
That's alright for me, but you should follow your own path.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:30.050
We're doing what we can for our own reasons.{situation/reasons/circumstances}

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:33.300
So it's fine to try your best for your own reasons.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.300
Yeah.

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:39.270
I certainly don't have any profound reasons like Tomoe does.

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:43.060
I don't, but...

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:46.400
I want to become stronger. Much stronger.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.230
Stronger?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.520
That's right.

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:51.860
By fighting against strong opponents, I want to become much, much stronger.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.610
Stronger than anyone else.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:56.260
That's your own decision, isn't it?

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:57.790
Pretty simple.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.730
Grandmother...

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:02.650
No...

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:04.800
Great Dantan, Holy Archbishop.{Great Dantan Holy Archbishop.seikikyou makes shit sense}

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:07.140
Presently, everything is in accordance with your will.

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:12.300
As the representative of your followers, I am determined to participate in Queen's Blade.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:16.850
To someone like me, who has spent most of their life following these sacred commands...

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:19.720
bestowing this great task upon me is truly a blessing.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:23.730
I am happy to become the foundation for our churches' roads.

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:30.890
What in the world is this?

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:32.950
My! My! My!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.030
My! My! My!

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:34.610
My! My! My!

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:39.040
Angel-sama! You're the Angel of Glory, Nanael-sama!

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:50.300
It's a bit far from the town, but it seems peaceful. Should we stay here?

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.230
Yeah, I like this place.

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:53.920
Ymir-chan?

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:56.890
I mean, Ymir-san, is this place alright with you?

00:08:56.890 --> 00:09:01.730
Idiot! Why do I have to stay in the same inn as my rival in trade?

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:04.030
Well, why did you come with us then?

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:06.920
We only went the same way by chance.

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:09.570
I've already decided where I'm going to stay.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:13.530
Ah, so that's how it was. I'm sorry for misunderstanding.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.120
Through this tournament,

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:19.490
I'll make the true strength of Steel Mountain's weapons known throughout the world!

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:24.710
The weapons you made this time look like mere cooking utensils to me.

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:26.160
Cattleya!

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.370
Know the extent of my determination!

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.130
Sure, sure.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.200
Even though you lost to Mommy.

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:33.050
Hey, Rana.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:38.160
Well then, as mutual weapon specialists, let's both try our best.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.510
Y...yeah.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.390
Well, let's go, Rana.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:44.450
Farewell, Ymir-ch- Ymir-san.

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:47.190
That woman...

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:50.700
I don't get why she's always treating me like a child.

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:50.700
Please excuse me!

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:52.680
I'm older than her.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:53.780
And that pair of tits!

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:56.650
She sure is a woman who ticks people off.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:59.400
Ah, welcome! How many guests?

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:00.320
Two.

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:01.410
Hmph!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:07.520
Amazing! Amazing! Amazing! So many humans!

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:12.290
I see, this is the first time you've been to such a big city.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.950
It's understandable that you're astonished.

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:17.040
Look, look, Instructor! Lots of fruit!

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:18.300
Can I take these?

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:21.960
Ah, no no! Those are for sale.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:23.300
I can't take them?

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.420
If you pay with money, it's fine to take them.

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.290
Money?

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:32.230
Instructor, this is terrible! So many fish are dead! The poor things.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:36.700
No, those aren't dead. Well, they're dead, but... it's alright.

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:38.280
Wait a second, don't touch them.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.430
It must be because wood elves don't eat fish.

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:46.090
Instructor, my clothes are bothering people!

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:50.350
I should have taught her a little more about human society...

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:51.580
Wait up, Nowa!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:59.430
As I thought, there's no other way.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:02.140
I must win Queen's Blade at all costs.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:06.330
I can't expect them to save me; there's no other path left for me.

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:09.970
What a gloomy face you're making. Why do you look so dark?

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:10.770
Echidna?!

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:14.690
Well, how many years has it been, Irma?

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.480
You've grown considerably.

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:18.600
Stop it!

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:23.200
Oh, isn't that too much? Even though it's such a nostalgic reunion.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:25.700
You've always been like that.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:29.000
Don't... appear before me anymore!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:34.670
Hmm? But you know, we might meet up again during Queen's Blade.

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:36.550
You're also...

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:38.550
I saw your fight.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:41.800
Your battle with that Hinomoto woman.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:46.560
You exposed your face to the entire world, and you're unable to return to your fellow assassins...

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:49.690
Don't come any closer! Hurry up and get out of my sight!

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:51.190
Oh? How scary.

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:54.730
Let me give you a bit of advice, since we're old friends.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.900
Don't underestimate the Queen.

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:00.070
Until we meet again.

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:07.990
That woman seems scary.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.000
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:22.660
At least spare me.

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:25.020
I'm scared.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:26.980
Don't come.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:52.840
Leina, Elina, Claudette...

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:56.000
So you three entered Gainos?

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:58.110
Queen's Blade...

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:01.100
How long must it continue?

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:05.970
After taking away my wife, Maria, you'll continue with taking my daughters?

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:15.450
We, the Vance family, are descendants of a royal family exiled by Queen's Blade.

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:18.060
With these hands, I shall certainly...

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.980
We are departing for Gainos!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.190
It's so dark, I can't see anything.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:44.050
Are you still looking for Leina?

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:48.420
After finally meeting with Onee-chan, she disappeared somewhere again.

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:50.180
I'll find her for sure, so...

00:13:58.650 --> 00:13:59.710
That power...

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:04.540
As I thought, even Leina is fit to become a champion of the Vance family.

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:05.650
However...

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:14.180
How is your wound, Onee-sama?

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:15.660
Ah, it should be fine.

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:21.330
Elina, you said you would participate in Queen's Blade to protect Leina, right?

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.280
That's right.

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:26.630
I can't just leave her alone when she's in a tournament full of such horrible people.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:30.720
You must defeat Leina with your own hands if you want to bring her back and embrace her.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:34.140
I'd have to defeat Onee-chan?

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:37.090
Leina is charmed by strong people.

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:40.290
So you mean she might fall for someone stronger than she is?

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:43.900
She may not fall for them, but she will certainly chase after them, at least.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:46.640
Hmm... I see.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.300
Alright, I get it!

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:53.330
I'll put my love for Onee-chan on the line and defeat her!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:57.390
You're displeased, aren't you?{pouting, sullen}

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.250
I still can't agree with it, after all.

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:04.150
Why do we have to participate in something like Queen's Blade?

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:07.760
Well, it's already been decided. Right, Setra?

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:11.640
There's nothing left to do but defeat everyone-

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:15.040
<i>Then I'll have to crush{smash/thwart/block} Queen's Blade with my own hands,</i>

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.770
is what you're going to say, right?

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:19.430
There's no need to do something so boring.

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:22.760
Wouldn't it be better to just kill Queen Aldra directly?

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.940
You'd better not.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:30.720
Even if she won the previous Queen's Blade, she's still human, right?

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.450
She's no match for us.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:36.800
How frequently have we lost to those fledgling humans?

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:40.410
Speaking of frequency, you're the one who lost the most, Melona.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:45.580
I'm trying to say that I'm different from before...

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:50.420
Fine. If you guys don't want to do it, I'll be going alone.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:54.890
If I take this form, I should be able to infiltrate the castle without raising suspicion.

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:58.100
Then, when Aldra lets her guard down, I'll get her from behind.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.120
Isn't that beside the point of Queen's Blade?

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.640
Shut up, you stupid cat!

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:05.820
This time I'll show the Swamp Witch my greatness.

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:07.070
Ah, Melona!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.690
She really went, eh?

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.990
I wonder if she'll really be alright?

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:14.050
An angel?

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:16.280
An angel is participating in Queen's Blade, you say?

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.760
One angel has been dispatched from heaven.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.700
It is difficult to determine what they are planning.

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:27.540
It is no matter.

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:28.480
Leave her be.

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:56.390
Why?! I searched so much, and yet...

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:01.140
Beautiful Aldra.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.280
Your eye is filled with sadness.

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:07.190
It is even more beautiful than usual.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:10.870
Are you thinking about that girl again?

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:12.700
That's because...

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:14.930
she means everything to me.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.490
I believe you'll find her for sure.

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:21.320
Because that is the reason you've obtained the great throne.

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:26.830
A servant of the Swamp Witch, eh?

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.620
You makeshift witch.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.750
You've been using petty underhanded tricks.

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:37.410
You were unable to defeat the others, so you decided to come directly for my head.

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.960
If you know that much already...

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.200
then we can cut this conversation short, eh?

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:47.430
Where is she?

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:55.300
Caught you.

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:59.720
What's this? You're weak, aren't you?

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:07.920
That's what happens when I get serious.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:10.770
With this, Queen's Blade is over.

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:17.940
You're kidding... right?

00:18:18.770 --> 00:18:20.000
Everything is...

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:22.660
predestined, as expected.

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:25.110
Shit...

00:18:25.110 --> 00:18:26.240
If that's the case...

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:30.080
Is that supposed to be my appearance?

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:34.380
This isn't just your appearance. Why must I tell you that?

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:40.470
How foolish.

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:47.480
My body is...

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:54.980
Your foolishness ends here, little girl.

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:56.730
I get it now.

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:58.020
You are...

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:00.610
No, you both are...

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:07.120
Heaven.

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:09.120
The demon clans.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:16.790
It seems everything in this world exists in order to take away my life.

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:19.440
Beautiful Aldra.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.760
Minagaki Mino.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:26.520
Everyone is envious of your strength and beauty.

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:28.340
But...

00:19:28.340 --> 00:19:32.130
The insolent ones who ignore the rules and point their swords at you...

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.690
must be erased without mercy, right?

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:36.270
Of course.

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:38.830
Your other self is needed.

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:40.070
My other self?

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:44.550
Your other self, who took your place in leading the Kiba assassins.

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:49.620
As a matter of fact, I've already found a worthy person.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.100
A worthy person?

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:53.520
I see.

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:00.630
At last, the real thing.

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:05.640
I have to continue winning till the end, then I'll teach those rotten nobles a lesson.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.030
A letter?

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:14.410
From a traveler.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:23.600
Right after Risty left on her journey, the Count's servants suddenly came...

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:26.950
and expelled us from the church.

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:32.380
Because the Count drove us out, we no longer have food or shelter.

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:33.970
If this goes on, we'll...

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:38.390
Risty, hurry and come back.

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:52.380
Treasure! There's so much treasure right there!

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:56.950
I guess this isn't the time to be participating in Queen's Blade.

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:00.350
Hey, isn't that it?

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:03.570
Ah, that's it, that's it! We're finally here!

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:07.490
I apologize for having you accompany us again.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:11.240
It's alright. I had fun talking with you.

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:16.540
Leina-san.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.420
Let us both do our best.

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:20.340
Yeah.

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:16.330
Hello, hello! It's everyones idol, Nanael-san!

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:19.710
No matter the time or place, I'm always healthy and energetic!

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:23.380
Shut up. Say, isn't it about time for you to disappear?

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:25.000
From now on, I'll be covering for you.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.000
So, you can just go to hell without any worries.

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:28.590
What do you want, flabby pink?

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:30.300
The toughest part is still ahead.

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:31.900
Don't underestimate this place!

00:23:31.900 --> 00:23:33.770
What kind of battles will we have tonight?!

00:23:33.770 --> 00:23:35.480
W-Wait, I'll do it!

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:36.940
Bye bye, Nanael.

00:23:36.940 --> 00:23:39.960
Well then, next time: Exorcism! Unexpected Battle!

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:42.400
Don't judge people by appearances alone.
